+# License, v. 2.0. If a copy of the MPL was not distributed with this
+# file, You can get one at http://mozilla.org/mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.
+
+# OpenHarmony 应用 mozbuild
+# stage2:构建 Gecko 内核核心(产出 libxul.so) + NAPI 桥接(产出 libgeckoview.so)。
+# ports/ohos 实现 geckoview.cpp(XRE_main 启动)、XComponentRenderer.cpp(Surface 渲染 stub)、
